    {
        "text": "Hurry! Get back! The Infected have turned into monsters!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh! I've been bit! I've been bit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ung.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaahh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "(Terrifying screaming).",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could this happen...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "What has that nasty little boy done?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, we need to move! We have to meet up with Amiya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "A small fire team can't handle a herd of this size. We have to tread carefully!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing we can do for the L. G. D. now. We're in a much worse position than them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Set them aside. My top priority is to guarantee your safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
