        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Nnng... Ngaaaa!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thank you, sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you hadn't come to help...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "Behind you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "C- counterattack!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is no use.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Form up. And fall back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_040",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, if we do that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't hold here. We have to find a way out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course! The high ground! We move up the stairs and attack down into the corridor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No. All we can do is hold. But at least we won't get cornered by this crowd of lunatics!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Come about, gather up at each doorway, pull back the teams, and take a defensive formation! Hurry! Move!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_040"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well done. I approve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_040",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, come with us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_040",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_040",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_040",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will move on the ground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
