    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't hold them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we have is piercing weapons, and they're useless against these things!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold your ground!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're the last line of defense for the civilians behind us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what do we do?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We fight to the last man!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch the Originium they're throwing. It corrodes your equipment, and some of them explode!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah...! They hit Ah Chung!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Chung, get back! You, move up! Don't let them through!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guuhhh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaaagh! Th- they got me! They're eating me! Noo! Aaaaieeeee!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Yee!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How embarrassing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zongguan Bailei Zhengfa, loose!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
