    {
        "text": "Nnng...!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lightning Arts?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "text": "H- how... you wiped them all out in one bright flash?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_039_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant...* *pant...*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just said I would not act. Little did I know how incapable you are of protecting the masses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "That I would be forced to take such action, it's humiliating!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Censor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam nothing! Were you not told to ignore my presence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...We never thought...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I found your spirit laudable. How disappointing it was to see you hopping about aimlessly, leaving me to do your work. Honestly, what were you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now! To your place!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But you just said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Chop chop! How have you not learned to move with haste even after witnessing me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, but of course. You did not witness me. I did nothing. Is that clear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Crystal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But if a single hair on the head of a single commoner comes to harm, you are all terminated. Even I must resign. We are all unemployed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y- yes, of course... We'll fight with all our strength.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Very good. Now why are you just standing there? Move!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way...? Do you know those Black Cloaks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Censor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Black Cloak? What's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "avg_npc_039_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
