    },
    {
        "text": "Recon team, fall back! Hold firing position!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are these Infected mutants messing with the radio waves? Our scouts could be in trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't hold them...! There's so many! Didn't you cut through a whole wave of these things back there? Why haven't you done that already?!",
