        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Leave it to this puk gaai Lung to be so useless right when we need her most!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
