    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. I can hear you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead. Speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We have... guests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Already? They took the chance to infiltrate our unit, huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess it's to be expected. They were never going to give us free rein.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, it doesn't change our plans. Let them see how strong Lungmen is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One more thing. I... I'm not sure how accurate the reports are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Some units have reported sightings of individuals wearing black raincoats.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thankfully no. We've seen evidence of them clashing with Reunion. And...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And... the Reunion they clashed with all seem to have died in, how can I describe it...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like an urban legend. You've got shadowy figures running around Lungmen in black raincoats on a bright, sunny day? Somebody needs help...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
